OL,9,     FPocket Bully facing surgery and an
OL,10,     Feight-month-old lurcher with
OL,11,     Fimpulse control issues.
OL,12,G2200 Ambulance
OL,13,     FNew. The service responds to two
OL,14,     Fseparate calls for patients with
OL,15,     Fsevere burns, both in need of
OL,16,     Furgent treatment at the region's
OL,17,     Fonly specialist burns unit.
