OL,5,G2300 Ambulance
OL,6,     FNew. As the night shift begins, 82
OL,7,     Fpatients across the North West are
OL,8,     Fwaiting for an ambulance. With a
OL,9,     Fnew call being taken every 30
OL,10,     Fseconds, paramedics are pushed to
OL,11,     Ftheir limits.
OL,12,G0000 Emergency: First Time Medics
OL,13,     FClaire comes face-to-face with
OL,14,     Fstretched NHS resources when she
OL,15,     Ftries to help a cancer patient
OL,16,     Fwho's bleeding heavily, and Ese
OL,17,     Fgrapples with a rare and
OL,18,     Fchallenging case of possible
OL,19,     Fpoisoning.
